        {
          "id": "yfcwnms94kqw",
          "status": "investigating",
          "body": "We continue to have active lines of investigation going with our upstream network provider partners, and are still working toward a resolution.\n\nThis issue affects the network-level access to projects. The projects themselves and the data in them are safe and unaffected.\n\nUsers are seeing two separate symptoms of these networking issues:\n\n1. DNS Lookup failures for supabase project URLs\n2. 530 responses to HTTP requests to supabase project API Endpoints",
