          "id": "ynk88xvyp0qh",
          "status": "investigating",
          "body": "We have further clarified the scope and impact of the issues currently affecting users. A subset of users across North and South America are experiencing DNS resolution failures and HTTP 530 errors.\nThese symptoms indicate a networking-related issue impacting the availability of Supabase projects. We are actively working with both internal teams and external network providers to isolate the root cause and determine the most effective path to resolution.\nWe will continue to provide updates as more information becomes available.",
